title: Swing Door
text: Red goes in. Yellow, magenta and cyan come out.
trick: a splitter sends red round a loop both ways, so one doppler is passed from both sides: red going east turns blue, red coming back west turns green, and the loop feeds the splitter again
motif: open field; three targets, the laser row carries two of them
ink: 1
expect: recolours>=2, merges>=1
